===Results===
Wyden won in a landslide, winning every county in the state with the exception of [[Malheur County, Oregon|Malheur County]]. Wyden's performance, both by his portion of the vote and margin of victory, would only be exceeded by his subsequent [[2004 United States Senate election in Oregon|2004 election]], being his second-best performance in a Senatorial election.

